{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12708","headline":"朝阳岩下歌 · 元结","name":"朝阳岩下歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝阳岩下湘水深，朝阳洞口寒泉清。\n零陵城郭夹湘岸，岩洞幽奇带郡城。\n荒芜自古人不见，零陵徒有先贤传。\n水石爲娱安可羡，长歌一曲留相劝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}